<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_III__cl_10__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
