<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_III__cl_10__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (2), by inserting after the words \"subsection (1)\" the words \"or any direction made under subsection (1B)\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
