<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_III__cl_11> <https://schema.org/name> "The English language text of subsection 105(2) of"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
