<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_III__cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
