<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A right of appeal to the Commodities Trading Commission under section 46, 73 or 95 of the repealed Act existing immediately before the commencement date shall, on the commencement date, be deemed to be a right of appeal to the Securities Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
