<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If, immediately before the commencement date, any criminal proceedings were pending in any court, the proceedings shall be continued as if the amendments made by this Act had not been passed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
