<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "For the avoidance of doubt, nothing in this section affects section 30 of the Interpretation Acts 1948 and 1967."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
