<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_22> <https://schema.org/name> "The members of the Management Board of a company"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "referred to in section 21 who were elected or appointed under subsection 22(2) of the repealed Act and holding office immediately before the commencement date shall continue to hold office for a period of one year from the commencement date as if they were the directors duly elected or appointed under section 5 of the principal Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
