<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "If, immediately before the commencement date, a company was a clearing house within the meaning of the repealed Act, that company shall, on commencement date, be deemed to have been approved as a clearing house under subsection 6B(l) of the principal Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
