<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_23__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/52/eng@> .
